\b 2. Database Design and Security\b0\par
The system uses PostgreSQL as the database engine and Prisma as the ORM. The schema was redesigned to support the CRM domain with relational integrity and security-oriented constraints. The main entities are:\par
- User\par
- Session\par
- Account\par
- Verification\par
- Company\par
- Client\par
- InvoiceSeries\par
- Invoice\par
- PasswordResetToken\par
- ActivityLog\par
\par
Security-related design decisions include unique constraints for VAT numbers, foreign keys for ownership and relationships, indexed columns for common queries, and controlled deletion behavior. Prisma is used to prevent SQL injection by avoiding manual string concatenation in queries.\par
\par
