\par
\b 3. Design of System Classes\b0\par
The application follows a service-based structure that fulfills the "system classes" requirement. The main service classes are:\par
- CompanyService\par
- ClientService\par
- InvoiceSeriesService\par
- InvoiceService\par
- ActivityService\par
- Authentication helper actions\par
\par
Each service contains the business logic for its specific domain, such as validation, uniqueness checks, list pagination, creation, update, deletion, and logging. This design separates business logic from route handlers and keeps the code easier to maintain and test.\par
\par
