\par
\b 4. Implementation of the Software System\b0\par
The implementation is based on Next.js with the App Router. The application includes dashboard pages and API route handlers for the core CRM modules. Implemented areas include:\par
- Login and session handling\par
- Dashboard shell and navigation\par
- Company list and create pages\par
- Client list and create pages\par
- Invoice series list and create pages\par
- Invoice list and create pages\par
- Prisma-based database access\par
\par
The system was built with TypeScript strict mode, Tailwind CSS, and reusable UI components. Server-side validation is handled with Zod, and the app uses a structured service layer for database operations.\par
