\b 5. System Testing\b0\par
The project was validated using build-time checks and schema validation. The following tests and checks were performed:\par
- Prisma schema validation\par
- Next.js production build\par
- Route handler compilation checks\par
- TypeScript type checking\par
- Manual smoke testing of the dashboard pages\par
\par
The build passed successfully, which confirms that the application compiles correctly and that the implemented modules are structurally consistent.\par
