\b Security Summary\b0\par
The system includes several security improvements compared to the legacy version:\par
- Server-side validation of input data\par
- ORM-based database access instead of raw SQL concatenation\par
- Ownership checks for company data\par
- Secure session handling\par
- Activity logging for important operations\par
\par
\b Conclusion\b0\par
The CRM system has been migrated to a modern Next.js architecture while preserving the original business domain. The project now demonstrates all six seminar requirements: requirements analysis, secure database design, system class design, implementation, testing, and documentation.\par
